From faca028b4f1cfaad199c5b3cb6dc174c0934b5ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:45:22 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: status panel for Characters, stat upgrades as a
 Buy-style counter

Choosing Characters shows the member's status as the Status screen's top rows
do (portrait, class, level, experience, HP, PP and the four stats, without the
Djinn rows or the coins and items) in the picker. The stat screen is replaced
by ArenaShop_Run's third counter: each stat is an entry with its booster item's
icon (Apple, Mint, Power Bread, Cookie, Hard Nut, Lucky Pepper), a price tag,
the name "<stat> Up" and a description of how much it adds and what it is now.
The overlay's list screens are gone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
